{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04913","headline":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方军大总管张仁亶 · 李乂","name":"奉和幸望春宫送朔方军大总管张仁亶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"边郊草具腓，河塞有兵机。\n上宰调梅寄，元戎细柳威。\n武貔东道出，鹰隼北庭飞。\n玉匣谋中野，金舆下太微。\n投醪衔饯酌，缉衮事征衣。\n勿谓公孙老，行闻奏凯归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李乂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}